  "ingredients": [
    "2 large egg",
    "1 1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/4 cup unsweetened dark cocoa powder",
    "1 teaspoon curry powder",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking soda",
    "1/4 teaspoon salt",
    "2 tablespoon butter (softened)",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "1/2 teaspoon apple cider vinegar",
    "10 drop liquid stevia",
    "1 cup erythritol (powdered)",
    "1/4 cup butter (softened)",
    "1/4 cup unsweetened carton coconut milk"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Bring all of the ingredients to room temperature and preheat the oven to 350F. An awesome trick for this with eggs is to submerge them into warm water!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together almond flour, cocoa powder, curry powder, baking soda, and salt.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate mixing bowl, beat butter and erythritol together until the butter is pale.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix 1 egg into the butter mixture at a time.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add your dry ingredients to the butter and eggs and mix together slowly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the ginger and liquid stevia here if you are using minced ginger, then continue to mix. Finally, mix in the apple cider vinegar.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide your batter into the cupcake tray holes and bake for 16-18 minutes (or until a toothpick comes out clean).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a spice grinder, grind the icing erythritol. Be sure to let this settle before removing the lid!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat icing butter until it's pale. Add 1/2 of the erythritol.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-09.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue mixing until well combined, then add coconut milk (the fatty part at the top of the can, if you can).",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix well until combined and then add the rest of the erythritol. Continue mixing until it is fluffy.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Measure out your icing into a piping bag. I have this cheap piping bag set that does amazingly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-12.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ice the cupcakes, then garnish with extra cocoa!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/chocolate-curry-cupcakes/#wprm-recipe-50461-step-0-12",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/chocolate-curry-cupcakes-step-13.jpg"
    }
  ],
